{"type":"message","id":"07c20a16","parentId":"9d805acc","timestamp":"2026-05-18T09:57:17.869Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_07dws9Njf4Wx2hRkzKQri0pA","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"261\t```bash\n   262\trm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/chart-generator/sessions/sessions.json\n   263\topenclaw agent --agent chart-generator --message \"CHART_COIN: ${CHART_COIN}\n   264\tCHART_DAYS: 30\n   265\tCHART_OUTPUT: /tmp/chart.png\" --deliver\n   266\t```\n   267\t\n   268\t**Validate chart:**\n   269\t```bash\n   270\tpython3 - <<'PYEOF'\n   271\timport sys, os, subprocess\n   272\tchart = '/tmp/chart.png'\n   273\tif not os.path.exists(chart):\n   274\t    print(\"CHART_MISSING\"); sys.exit(1)\n   275\tsize = os.path.getsize(chart)\n   276\tif size < 5000:\n   277\t    print(f\"CHART_INVALID: only {size} bytes\"); sys.exit(1)\n   278\tr = subprocess.run(['file', chart], capture_output=True, text=True)\n   279\tif 'PNG' not in r.stdout:\n   280\t    print(\"CHART_INVALID: not a PNG\"); sys.exit(1)\n   281\tprint(f\"CHART_VALID: {size} bytes\")\n   282\tPYEOF\n   283\t```\n   284\t\n   285\t**If chart fails:** Retry chart-generator once. If still fails after retry:\n   286\t```bash\n   287\tpython3 -c \"\n   288\timport re\n   289\twith open('/tmp/crypto-article.md') as f: content = f.read()\n   290\tcontent = content.replace('[CHART_PLACEHOLDER]', '')\n   291\tcontent = re.sub(r'\\n{3,}', '\\n\\n', content)\n   292\twith open('/tmp/crypto-article.md', 'w') as f: f.write(content)\n   293\tprint('No chart available — placeholders stripped from article')\n   294\t\"\n   295\techo '0' > /tmp/expected_placeholders.txt\n   296\t```\n   297\t\n   298\t**Update manifest:**\n   299\t```bash\n   300\tpython3 -c \"\n   301\timport json\n   302\tm = json.load(open('/tmp/pipeline-manifest.json'))\n   303\tm['current_step'] = 'generate_chart'\n   304\tm['next_step'] = 'generate_image'\n   305\tm['steps']['generate_chart'] = {'status': 'succeeded'}\n   306\topen('/tmp/pipeline-manifest.json','w').write(json.dumps(m, indent=2))\n   307\t\"\n   308\t```\n   309\t\n   310\tSend user: \"✅ Chart ready, generating feature image now...\"\n   311\t\n   312\t**⚡ DO NOT STOP. Immediately run Step 3 below.**\n   313\t\n   314\t---\n   315\t\n   316\t### Step 3 — Generate Feature Image\n   317\t\n   318\t```bash\n   319\trm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/creator/sessions/sessions.json\n   320\topenclaw agent --agent creator --message \"Generate a feature image for this article. Read /tmp/research.json to find the article title, topic, and primary crypto asset. Use the Scene Formula in your SOUL.md to pick the right human subject and scene, then run the API calls and logo stamp steps exactly as defined in your SOUL.md.\" --deliver\n   321\t```\n   322\t\n   323\t**Validate feature image (non-blocking — failure does not stop pipeline):**\n   324\t```bash\n   325\tpython3 - <<'PYEOF'\n   326\timport os, sys, subprocess\n   327\timg = '/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg'\n   328\tif not os.path.exists(img):\n   329\t    print(\"IMAGE_MISSING: skipping feature image\"); sys.exit(0)\n   330\tsize = os.path.getsize(img)\n   331\tif size < 10000:\n   332\t    print(f\"IMAGE_WARN: small file ({size} bytes)\")\n   333\tr = subprocess.run(['file', img], capture_output=True, text=True)\n   334\tif 'JPEG' not in r.stdout and 'image' not in r.stdout.lower():\n   335\t    print(\"IMAGE_WARN: may not be valid JPEG\")\n   336\tprint(f\"IMAGE_VALID: {size} bytes\")\n   337\tPYEOF\n   338\t```\n   339\t\n   340\t**Update manifest:**\n   341\t```bash\n   342\tpython3 -c \"\n   343\timport json\n   344\tm = json.load(open('/tmp/pipeline-manifest.json'))\n   345\tm['current_step'] = 'generate_image'\n   346\tm['next_step'] = 'publish_drive'\n   347\tm['steps']['generate_image'] = {'status': 'succeeded'}\n   348\topen('/tmp/pipeline-manifest.json','w').write(json.dumps(m, indent=2))\n   349\t\"\n   350\t```\n   351\t\n   352\tSend user: \"✅ Image ready, publishing to Google Drive now...\"\n   353\t\n   354\t**⚡ DO NOT STOP. Immediately run Step 4 below.**\n   355\t\n   356\t---\n   357\t\n   358\t### Step 4 — Publish to Google Drive\n   359\t\n   360\t**Build the export file:**\n   361\t```bash\n   362\tif [ -f /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg ] && [ $(stat -c%s /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg) -gt 10000 ]; then\n   363\t  printf '![Feature Image](/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg)\\n\\n' | cat - /tmp/crypto-article.md > /tmp/crypto-with-image.md\n   364\telse\n   365\t  cp /tmp/crypto-article.md /tmp/crypto-with-image.md\n   366\tfi\n   367\t```\n   368\t\n   369\t**Replace `[CHART_PLACEHOLDER]` BEFORE pandoc:**\n   370\t```bash\n   371\tpython3 - <<'PYEOF'\n   372\timport os, re\n   373\t\n   374\twith open('/tmp/crypto-with-image.md', 'r') as f:\n   375\t    content = f.read()\n   376\t\n   377\tchart = '/tmp/chart.png'\n   378\tif os.path.exists(chart) and os.path.getsize(chart) > 5000:\n   379\t    content = content.replace('[CHART_PLACEHOLDER]', '![Price Chart](/tmp/chart.png)')\n   380\t    print(\"[CHART] Replaced placeholders with chart image reference\")\n   381\telse:\n   382\t    content = content.replace('[CHART_PLACEHOLDER]', '')\n   383\t    content = re.sub(r'\\n{3,}', '\\n\\n', content)\n   384\t    print(\"[CHART] No valid chart — stripped placeholders\")\n   385\t\n   386\twith open('/tmp/crypto-with-image.md', 'w') as f:\n   387\t    f.write(content)\n   388\tPYEOF\n   389\t\n   390\tpandoc /tmp/crypto-with-image.md -o /tmp/crypto-article.docx --standalone\n   391\t```\n   392\t\n   393\t**Upload to Google Drive:**\n   394\t```bash\n   395\trm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/publisher/sessions/sessions.json\n   396\topenclaw agent --agent publisher --message \"Run this EXACT shell command and return its JSON output: GOG_KEYRING_PASSWORD=\\\"sawan\\\" gog drive upload /tmp/crypto-article.docx --name \\\"Crypto News - $(date +%Y-%m-%d)\\\" --json --no-input --account bhardwaj0sawan@gmail.com — Return the webViewLink from the JSON output.\" --deliver\n 